  "sourceTitle": "Partly Cloudy",
  "sourceText": "Partly Cloudy\nBy: Andie Mitchell\nPublished: Thursday, February 11, 2010 - 8:46pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 ounce Vodka\n1 ounce Blue Curacao or Schnapps\n1 ounce pina colada mix\nlemonade\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine vodka, Blue Curacao, and pina colada mix in a shaker with ice. Shake and pour into a glass to serve. Fill to the brim with lemonade if desired.",
